content.text:
请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-30-pet-feeder-008

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
弄个喂食器卡啊,主体是个图,点下能去设置,能读天气,看到红色危险提示

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "弄个喂食器卡啊,主体是个图,点下能去设置,能读天气,看到红色危险提示",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings",
        "abilityName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings.MainAbility",
        "uri": "intelligent_scene_entry"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "data": {
      "weather": {
        "location": {
          "districtName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "天气查询区县或当前位置名称",
            "sampleValue": "当前位置"
          }
        },
        "current": {
          "temperatureText": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前温度展示文本",
            "sampleValue": "28°C"
          },
          "condition": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前天气现象",
            "sampleValue": "雷雨"
          },
          "alertLevel": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "天气预警或危险提示等级",
            "sampleValue": "红色危险"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/thunderstorm.png",
      "description": "雷暴天气彩色图标，适合作为喂食器天气风险场景的主体图，表达恶劣天气和危险提醒。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","catalogId":"ohos.a2ui.extended.catalog","width":140,"height":140}}
{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","root":"root","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Column","children":["top_row","hero_image","info_panel"],"itemMargin":4,"styles":{"width":140,"height":140,"padding":12,"borderRadius":18,"clip":true,"backgroundColor":"#fff1f3f5","justifyContent":"start","alignItems":"center"}},{"id":"top_row","component":"Row","children":["title_text","alert_badge"],"itemMargin":4,"styles":{"width":116,"height":24,"justifyContent":"start","alignItems":"center"}},{"id":"title_text","component":"Text","content":"喂食器","styles":{"width":52,"height":20,"fontSize":14,"fontWeight":700,"fontColor":"#e5000000","maxLines":1}},{"id":"alert_badge","component":"Row","children":["alert_text"],"styles":{"width":60,"height":24,"padding":[0,4,0,4],"borderRadius":12,"linearGradient":{"direction":"Right","colors":[["#ffed6f21",0],["#ed955f",1]]},"justifyContent":"center","alignItems":"center"}},{"id":"alert_text","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/data/weather/current/alertLevel} }}","styles":{"width":52,"height":18,"fontSize":12,"fontWeight":700,"fontColor":"#ffffffff","maxLines":1,"textAlign":"center"}},{"id":"hero_image","component":"Image","src":"resources/base/media/thunderstorm.png","onClick":[{"call":"clickToDeeplink","args":{"bundleName":"com.huawei.hmos.settings","abilityName":"com.huawei.hmos.settings.MainAbility","uri":"intelligent_scene_entry"}}],"styles":{"width":52,"height":52,"objectFit":"contain"}},{"id":"info_panel","component":"Row","children":["weather_text"],"styles":{"width":116,"height":32,"padding":[0,8,0,8],"borderRadius":16,"backgroundColor":"#19000000","justifyContent":"center","alignItems":"center"}},{"id":"weather_text","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/data/weather/current/condition} + ' ' + ${/data/weather/current/temperatureText} }}","styles":{"width":100,"height":18,"fontSize":12,"fontWeight":500,"fontColor":"#99000000","maxLines":1,"textAlign":"center"}}]}}
{"version":"v0.9","updateDataModel":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","path":"/","value":{"data":{"weather":{"location":{"districtName":"当前位置"},"current":{"temperatureText":"28°C","condition":"雷雨","alertLevel":"红色危险"}}},"state":{"loading":false}}}}

=== 渲染截图 ===
⚠️ 本评分以随附的 card.dsl.png 渲染截图为唯一且最终的依据。请务必先认真看图，根据图中实际呈现的效果打分；上面的 DSL 与 system 中的布局公式仅用于协议合规性检查与改进版 DSL 的撰写，绝不能仅凭 DSL 文本/数值给分。排版与美观问题以截图为准。

输出要求：严格按 system 中规定的 JSON schema 输出单个 JSON 对象，reasons 必须基于截图描述具体视觉现象，improved_dsl 为 3 行合法 JSONL。
